{"title":"배타적 연애금지구역","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bVyWUp/hywgJ59tdj/GVe6MVZ2aCKLli2tvKcKt0&filename=th3","synopsis":"※ 본 작품은 15세 이용가로 재편집되었습니다.\n\n#알파x베타 #착각계 #리맨물 #철벽수 #세계관_최고_미남수\n\n내 이름은 김주혁. 난 베타다.\n회사를 다니며 난 한 가지 깨달음을 얻었다.\n알파와 오메가가 지지고 볶는 이 사회는 답이 없다.\n\n날마다 찾아오는 상사도, 엄청나게 귀여운 오메가 사원도 다 꺼졌으면 좋겠다.\n나한테 필요한 건 퇴사와 하와이 여행이지, 연애가 아니다.\n\n내 영역에선 그 어떤 연애도 허용하지 않는다.\n\n배타적 연애금지구역 선포였다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":230,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":511284,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":511352,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":511353,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":511354,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":511369,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":511388,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":511396,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":511415,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":511454,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":511459,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":511459,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":511459,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":511459,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":511464,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":511469,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":511469,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":511470,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":511504,"rc":3310,"rs":33063,"cc":802}]}